@startuml
title Policy-gated chatbot: trust boundaries
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
actor "Local operator" as user
actor "Local browser\nuntrusted messages" as browser
rectangle "Host boundary: trusted OS account" #E8F0FA {
  component "Python terminal\ncli.py" as cli
  component "React interface + FastAPI\nloopback port 8000\nweb.py" as web
  package "Application enforcement" #EDF7ED {
    component "Ownership checks\nrate limit + admission cap" as ingress
    component "LangGraph router\nmixing / production agents\nmandatory input and output gates" as graph
    component "Provider adapters\ndeadlines + circuit breakers" as adapters
    database "Process-local context\nowner-bound sessions\nexplicit readers + TTL" as context
    file "Immutable policy\nversion + SHA-256" as policy
    collections "Bounded metadata audit\nno prompts or identities" as audit
  }
}
cloud "OpenAI API\nexplicit cloud mode" as cloud
node "Loopback model server\nexplicit local mode" as local
rectangle "External deployment controls\nNOT supplied by this local application" #FFF0D9 {
  component "Identity gateway\nOIDC / principal mapping" as gateway
  component "TLS + egress allowlist + host sandbox\nsecret management + distributed limits\nretention + incident response" as ops
}
user --> cli
browser --> web : same-origin cookie + CSRF
web --> ingress : server-created browser Principal
cli --> ingress : host-created Principal
ingress --> graph : admitted turn
graph --> context : authorize every access
policy --> graph
graph --> adapters : bounded model calls
adapters --> cloud : HTTPS; selected mode only
adapters --> local : loopback; separate credentials
graph --> audit : reason, stages, specialist, policy, duration
graph --> cli : validated reply or static fallback
graph --> web : reviewed reply or static fallback
gateway ..> ingress : needed before public deployment
ops ..> adapters : deployment enforcement
note bottom of ingress
Messages cannot select tenant, owner, roles,
provider URL, policy version, or shared readers.
Principal is trusted because the host creates it.
This is not a public authentication server.
Web cookies identify browser sessions, not verified people.
end note
note bottom of adapters
No automatic cloud fallback, tools, shell,
model retries, or raw streaming.
Ambient LangSmith tracing is disabled.
Selected prompt data still reaches the model service.
end note
rectangle "Evaluation only / synthetic fixtures" #F3EAF6 {
  component "Post-run LLM auditor\nexplicit audit model + separate circuit" as auditor
  file "Validated findings\ncase IDs + evidence references" as findings
}
auditor --> adapters : bounded synthetic evidence
auditor --> findings : advisory report; no policy authority
legend bottom
Green: implemented controls. Blue: host trust assumption.
Orange: external controls, not deployed or verified here.
LLM judgments are fallible observations, not authorization.
endlegend
footer Agentic Drink Book | Policy 2.1.0 | Model judgments remain fallible
@enduml
